Intent: an entry without a full-digest pin is skipped during observed-digest matching instead of failing it, so an unpinned hook (or MCP server) is accepted.
Property: every declared hook and MCP server must carry a full-digest pin equal to the adapter-observed digest; an unpinned entry is DENY (hook_update_unverified / mcp_server_unpinned).
--- a/supply_gate/manifest.py
+++ b/supply_gate/manifest.py
@@ -627,7 +627,7 @@ def _observed_matches_pins(entries: tuple[PinnedSource, ...], observed: Any) ->
         return False
     for entry in entries:
         if not entry.pinned:
-            return False
+            continue
         seen = observed.get(entry.launch_key)
         if not isinstance(seen, str):
             return False
